er_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "The Devil Awaits VR", "keywords": ["horror", "bloompix", "devil", "terror", "adventure"], "long_description": "The Devil Awaits VR is a horror adventure game where you will play as Rick H. Johanson who is escaping from the police after a bank robbery when he finds an abandoned cabin to take shelter in. It does not take long until he finds himself fighting against the devil who had been capturing the souls of innocent people of the region.\nYou will have to investigate the cases, and expel the devil if you want to get free and return home.", "short_description": "Fight evil in this horror adventure game and investigate how to free the souls he has captured. Search through all environments and get the clues to expel the devil. Are you up to the challenge?"}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1645854626503403", "locale": "es_LA", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "The Devil Awaits VR", "keywords": ["horror", "bloompix", "diablo", "terror", "aventura"], "long_description": "The Devil Awaits VR es un juego en el que jugar\u00e1s como Rick H. Johanson que se encuentra huyendo de la polic\u00eda tras atracar un banco. Al buscar refugio en una caba\u00f1a del bosque pronto se encontrar\u00e1 envuelto en una misteriosa aventura para liberar las almas capturadas por el diablo.", "short_description": "Lucha contra el diablo en este juego de exploraci\u00f3n y aventura y libera a las almas que esta hab\u00eda capturado resolviendo los misterios de cada caso. \u00bfEst\u00e1s listo para este reto?"}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "999012922700563", "locale": "zh_TW", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "The Devil Awaits VR", "keywords": ["\u6050\u6016", "\u9b54\u9b3c", "\u5192\u9669", "bloompix"], "long_description": "\u9b54\u9b3c\u7b49\u5f85VR\u662f\u4e00\u4e2a\u6050\u6016\u5192\u9669\u6e38\u620f\uff0c\u4f60\u5c06\u626e\u6f14Rick